# Maven 4 default options — applied to every mvnw invocation
# See: https://maven.apache.org/configure.html#maven-config-file

# Parallel build: 1 thread per CPU core (20 threads on a 20-core machine).
# Modules without inter-dependencies compile/install concurrently.
# Note: some plugins (kapt, remote-resources) are not marked thread-safe,
# so those goals serialize while others run in parallel.
-T 1C

# Kotlin incremental compilation.
# NOTE: the project uses kapt (Spring/JPA/all-open annotation processing),
# and kapt forces NON_INCREMENTAL_COMPILER mode — the Kotlin daemon ignores
# this property when kapt is active. Keeping it here for the day kapt is
# removed or incremental-kapt (kapt.use.k2=true) becomes stable.
-Dkotlin.incremental=true
